ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT
------------------------

This app is licensed under the MIT License, which permits reuse, modification
and redistribution, but it requires one thing in return: the notice above must
travel with the software.

If you redistribute FreePN in whole or in part — a fork, a modified build, a
repackaged copy — you must keep this attribution intact:

    FreePN — Copyright (c) 2026 YandiDesign — https://github.com/YandiDesign
    Licensed under the MIT License.

You may add your own attribution alongside it, but you may not remove or
replace this one.

The same notice must remain visible in the application itself. That is why the
About section in Settings shows it rather than hiding it in a submenu.

